        "TileImage": "$($repository 6761ade2-5db5-48e8-8170-91676396b9fb).Image",
        "Description": "Our client, a power company has had one of their blueprints leaked by an ex employee working at the company and has managed to strike a deal with a competitor who is known to sabotage and play dirty. Our client does not want this to happen due to the amount of damage this can cause and has asked us to stop the deal from happening. They have told us that if any sign of suspicion is spotted, the deal will automatically go through failing the contract. Make sure this does not happen.",
